The SPK references official container images, downloaded by Container Manager;
it does not redistribute their image layers.

Paperless-ngx official images:
https://github.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx
https://hub.docker.com/r/paperlessngx/paperless-ngx
PostgreSQL official image: https://hub.docker.com/_/postgres
Redis official image: https://hub.docker.com/_/redis

Chinese OCR models are obtained from the unmodified official tessdata_fast
revision recorded in container/bootstrap.py, under Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tessdata_fast/blob/main/LICENSE

The released SDK/CLI bundle their own notices in the SPK. The templates UI
version is recorded for the toolchain; this integration serves the unmodified
upstream Angular application and does not add a separate Vue UI.

